This approach should work because:
1. It removes the dependency on the DataTable context
2. It still maintains the visual structure and functionality demo
3. It allows the preview to render without errors
4. It keeps the essential styling and layout

The preview will now show a simplified version of the toolbar that looks similar but doesn't require the complex context setup. This is a common approach for component previews where we want to show the UI without all the complex functionality.

